#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:1
msgid "无人机应用 - ArduPilot"
msgstr "UAV Integration - ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **D20** 接入 ArduPilot 飞控，并在地面站中持续查看 GPS 与 RTK 状态。常规使"
"用无人机版固件，默认输出 **10 Hz UBX** 定位数据。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the **D20** to the ArduPilot flight controller, and continuously "
"monitor the GPS and RTK status in the ground station. Use the standard drone "
"firmware, which outputs **10 Hz UBX** positioning data by default."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:9
msgid ""
"根据现场条件选择 4G 或 LoRa 差分链路。固件选择见[固件与输出协议选择](../"
"operation/firmware-output.md)，完整 Pin 定义见[D20 接口与接线](../operation/"
"d20-wiring.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a 4G or LoRa correction link for the site. See [Selecting Firmware "
"and Output Protocol](../operation/firmware-output.md) and [D20 Interfaces "
"and Wiring](../operation/d20-wiring.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:11
msgid "硬件连接"
msgstr "Hardware connection"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:14
msgid ""
"先核对 D20 8-pin 线束，再连接飞控电源 保持设备和飞控断电，并按[完整 8-pin 定"
"义](../operation/d20-wiring.md)逐线核对。D20 供电为 5 V ±0.5 V，UART/PPS I/O "
"为 3.3 V；反接电源或把 5 V 接入信号线可能损坏设备。"
msgstr ""
"Check the D20 8-pin harness before connecting flight-controller power. Keep "
"both devices powered off and verify every wire against the [complete 8-pin "
"pinout](../operation/d20-wiring.md). Supply 5 V ±0.5 V; UART/PPS I/O is 3.3 "
"V. Reversed supply polarity or 5 V on a signal pin may damage the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:17
msgid "将 D20 安装在无人机顶部、天空视野开阔的位置。"
msgstr ""
"Install the D20 on the top of the drone, in a position with an unobstructed "
"view of the sky."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:18
msgid "将通信天线固定牢靠，避开桨叶、碳板、大电流线缆和强干扰源。"
msgstr ""
"Secure the communication antenna firmly, avoiding blades, carbon plates, "
"high-current cables, and strong sources of interference."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:19
msgid "D20 TX 接飞控 GPS/UART RX，D20 RX 接飞控 GPS/UART TX。"
msgstr ""
"Connect D20 TX to the flight controller GPS/UART RX, and D20 RX to the "
"flight controller GPS/UART TX."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:20
msgid "D20 GND 与飞控 GND 共地。"
msgstr "D20 GND shares a ground with the flight controller GND."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:22
msgid ""
"若飞控提供明确 Pin 定义的标准 6-pin GPS/UART 接口，可以使用配套的 D20 8-pin "
"转飞控 6-pin 转接线。连接前必须同时核对转接线两端 Pin 顺序、D20 8-pin 定义和"
"飞控接口定义；接口外形匹配不代表线序一定匹配。"
msgstr ""
"If the flight controller has a clearly defined standard 6-pin GPS/UART port, "
"use the supplied D20 8-pin-to-6-pin adapter cable. Before connecting, verify "
"the pin order at both ends, the D20 8-pin pinout, and the flight-controller "
"port definition. Matching connector shapes do not guarantee matching pin "
"assignments."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:24
msgid "飞控侧配置"
msgstr "Flight controller configuration"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:26
msgid "飞控侧应启用实际连接 D20 的 GPS/UART 端口，并按以下边界配置："
msgstr ""
"The flight control side should enable the GPS/UART port actually connected "
"to D20 and configure it according to the following boundaries:"

