msgid "UBX"
msgstr "UBX"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "定位更新率"
msgstr "Location update rate"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "默认 10 Hz"
msgstr "Default 10 Hz"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:35
msgid ""
"不同飞控硬件、ArduPilot 版本和端口编号对应的参数名称可能不同，应以实际飞控文"
"档和地面站界面为准。"
msgstr ""
"The parameter names corresponding to different flight control hardware, "
"ArduPilot versions, and port numbers may vary, and should be based on the "
"actual flight control documentation and ground station interface."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:37
msgid "CUAV 7-Nano 配置示例"
msgstr "CUAV 7-Nano Configuration Example"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:39
msgid ""
"以下界面来自 CUAV 7-Nano、ArduCopter V4.7.0-dev 和 Mission Planner 1.3.83，仅"
"用于说明一套具体接入方式。其他飞控或固件版本的串口编号、参数名称和可选值可能"
"不同，配置前必须先核对对应版本的飞控文档。"
msgstr ""
"The following interface is from CUAV 7-Nano, ArduCopter V4.7.0-dev, and "
"Mission Planner 1.3.83, and is only used to illustrate a specific connection "
"method. The serial port numbers, parameter names, and optional values of "
"other flight controllers or firmware versions may differ, and the "
"corresponding flight controller documentation must be checked before "
"configuration."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:41
msgid "接线示例"
msgstr "Wiring Example"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:43
msgid "![D20 接入 CUAV 7-Nano GPS 接口示意图](../images/ardupilot-serial.png)"
msgstr ""
"![D20 Connection to CUAV 7-Nano GPS Interface Diagram](../images/ardupilot-"
"serial.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:43
msgid "D20 接入 CUAV 7-Nano GPS 接口示意图"
msgstr "D20 Connection Diagram to CUAV 7-Nano GPS Interface"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:45
msgid ""
"图中的彩色引导线只用于表示信号对应关系，不代表交付线束颜色。连接时仍须以 D20 "
"8-pin Pin 顺序、转接线功能标签和飞控接口定义为准。"
msgstr ""
"The colored guide lines in the diagram are only used to indicate signal "
"correspondences and do not represent the colors of the delivered wiring "
"harness. When connecting, you must still follow the D20 8-pin pin sequence, "
"the adapter cable function labels, and the flight control interface "
"definitions."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:47
msgid "参数示例"
msgstr "Parameter Example"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:49
msgid ""
"本示例使用 CUAV 7-Nano 的主 GPS 接口，对应 `SERIAL3`。参数值应按实际端口和飞"
"控版本核对："
msgstr ""
"This example uses the main GPS interface of the CUAV 7-Nano, corresponding "
"to `SERIAL3`. The parameter values should be checked according to the actual "
"port and flight controller version:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "示例值"
msgstr "Example value"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Function"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL`"
msgstr "`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`5`"
msgstr "`5`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "将对应串口配置为 GPS"
msgstr "Configure the corresponding serial port as GPS"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`SERIAL3_BAUD`"
msgstr "`SERIAL3_BAUD`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`115`"
msgstr "`115`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "ArduPilot 参数值 `115` 对应 115200 bps"
msgstr "The ArduPilot parameter value `115` corresponds to 115200 bps"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`GPS_AUTO_CONFIG`"
msgstr "`GPS_AUTO_CONFIG`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "关闭飞控对 GPS 的自动配置"
msgstr "Disable automatic GPS configuration in the flight controller"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH`"
msgstr "`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "单 GPS 场景固定使用主 GPS；多 GPS 场景按实际需求配置"
msgstr ""
"In a single GPS scenario, use the main GPS exclusively; in multiple GPS "
"scenarios, configure according to actual needs."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`GPS1_TYPE`"
msgstr "`GPS1_TYPE`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`2`"
msgstr "`2`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "将 GPS1 输入类型设置为 u-blox/UBX"
msgstr "Set GPS1 input type to u-blox/UBX"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`GPS1_RATE_MS`"
msgstr "`GPS1_RATE_MS`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "`100`"
msgstr "`100`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:13
msgid "将 GPS1 更新周期设置为 100 ms，即 10 Hz"
msgstr "Set the GPS1 update period to 100 ms, that is, 10 Hz"

