#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:60
msgid "Mission Planner GPS 通用参数示例"
msgstr "Mission Planner GPS General Parameter Example"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:62
msgid ""
"![Mission Planner GPS1 类型与更新率示例](../images/mission-planner-gps1.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Mission Planner GPS1 Type and Update Rate Example](../images/mission-"
"planner-gps1.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:62
msgid "Mission Planner GPS1 类型与更新率示例"
msgstr "Mission Planner GPS1 Type and Update Rate Example"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:64
msgid "验证"
msgstr "Verify"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:66
msgid "确认飞控和地面站能够识别 GPS，定位数据持续更新。"
msgstr ""
"Verify that the flight controller and ground station recognize the GPS and "
"update positioning data continuously."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:67
msgid "在开阔环境确认进入 RTK 固定解。"
msgstr "Verify an RTK fixed solution with an open sky view."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:68
msgid "解锁飞行前确认定位稳定、无异常跳变。"
msgstr "Before arming, verify stable positioning with no abnormal jumps."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:70
msgid "接入完成判据"
msgstr "Integration success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:73
msgid "飞控持续识别 GPS，开阔环境进入 **RTK 固定解**，且解锁飞行前状态稳定。"
msgstr ""
"The flight controller continuously recognizes the GPS, reaches an **RTK "
"fixed solution** with an open sky view, and remains stable before arming."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/ardupilot.md:76
msgid ""
"若飞控无法识别 D20，先检查无人机版固件、115200 bps 波特率、3.3 V UART 电平兼"
"容性和 TX/RX 接线。有定位输出但无法进入固定解时，按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../"
"operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)检查差分配置和现场条件。"
msgstr ""
"If the flight controller cannot recognize D20, first check the drone's "
"firmware, 115200 bps baud rate, 3.3 V UART level compatibility, and TX/RX "
"wiring. If there is positioning output but it cannot achieve a fixed "
"solution, follow [Checking RTK Status and the Fixed Solution](../operation/"
"rtk-fixed-validation.md) to check the correction setup and field conditions."

